A block opener past a nested footnote definition opens in the item

```
- body

  [^g]: n
   # h

after
.
<ul>
  <li>body
    <h1 id="h">h</h1>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>after</p>
```

```
- body

  [^g]: n
   > z

after
.
<ul>
  <li>body
    <blockquote><p>z</p></blockquote>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>after</p>
```

```
- body

  [^g]: n
   prose

after
.
<ul>
  <li><p>body</p>
    <p>prose</p>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>after</p>
```

```
- body

  [^g]: n
   - item

after
.
<ul>
  <li>body
    <ul>
      <li>item</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>after</p>
```
